note right of DP
  **DelegationProxy Pattern**
  1. IMC_CLI creates DefaultIMC
  2. DelegationProxy.start(imc) wraps it
  3. Missing methods intercepted by Proxy
  4. Proxy delegates to Web4TSComponent
  5. W4TSC executes (build, test, links...)
  6. Returns to IMC for chaining
end note

note bottom of DW4TSC
  **Web4 Principles Applied**
  P6: Empty constructor + init()
  P16: Object.verb naming (links(), build(), test())
  P19: One File One Type
  P4: No arrow functions
end note

DCLI ..> TSC : uses for\nmethod discovery
DCLI ..> DC : uses for\ncolored output

